  "notes": "{広|ひろ}まる describes information, customs, or influence spreading among people or across an area.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{広|ひろ}める→広める：02405_hiromeru⟧ (transitive, to spread something)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{広|ひろ}まって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates something has spread and is now widespread.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{噂|うわさ}→噂：01871_uwasa⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{広|ひろ}まる: a rumor spreads\n- ⟦{習慣|しゅうかん}→習慣：01429_shuukan⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{広|ひろ}まる: a custom spreads\n- ⟦{世界中|せかいじゅう}→世界中：10171_sekaijuu⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{広|ひろ}まる: to spread throughout the world\n- ⟦{急速|きゅうそく}→急速：02634_kyuusoku⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{広|ひろ}まる: to spread rapidly\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{広|ひろ}がる→広がる：01980_hirogaru⟧: to spread physically (in space); {広|ひろ}まる focuses on spread among people or as knowledge",
